# Mailing List Subscribers
# =========================
# This file contains the list of subscribed email addresses.
# One email address per line.
# Lines starting with # are treated as comments and ignored.
# 
# Format for new subscriptions:
#   # YYYY-MM-DD
#   email@example.com
#
# Format for unsubscriptions:
#   # YYYY-MM-DD
#   # email@example.com
#   # YYYY-MM-DD unsubscribed
#
# This file is automatically read and written by mailing.py.

